    {
      "topLeftX": 80,
      "topLeftY": 125,
      "bottomRightX": 585,
      "bottomRightY": 164,
      "content": "On the classical theory we can multiply two harmonic components related to the same set of $\\kappa$'s, as follows :—",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 130,
      "topLeftY": 176,
      "bottomRightX": 552,
      "bottomRightY": 196,
      "content": "$$a_{\\alpha\\kappa} \\exp. i (\\alpha\\omega)_\\kappa t \\cdot b_{\\beta\\kappa} \\exp. i (\\beta\\omega)_\\kappa t = (ab)_{\\alpha+\\beta,\\kappa} \\exp. i (\\alpha + \\beta, \\omega)_\\kappa t$$",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "equation"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 80,
