      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 273,
      "topLeftY": 211,
      "bottomRightX": 393,
      "bottomRightY": 231,
      "content": "$$(ab)_{\\alpha+\\beta,\\kappa} = a_{\\alpha\\kappa} b_{\\beta\\kappa}.$$",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "equation"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 78,
      "topLeftY": 241,
      "bottomRightX": 583,
      "bottomRightY": 279,
      "content": "In a corresponding manner on the quantum theory we can multiply an $(nm)$ and an $(mk)$ component",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 112,
      "topLeftY": 291,
      "bottomRightX": 552,
      "bottomRightY": 310,
      "content": "$$a (nm) \\exp. i\\omega (nm) t \\cdot b (mk) \\exp. i\\omega (mk) t = ab (nk) \\exp. i\\omega (nk) t$$",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "equation"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 78,
      "topLeftY": 321,
